@startuml
title Estrategia de Testing — Pirámide de Pruebas

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #444444
  FontSize 13
}

rectangle "**Capa 3 — E2E**\n----\nPlaywright\n_electron.launch()\n----\nFlujos completos en la app de escritorio\n----\nPocos tests · lentos · alta confianza" as E2E #FFB3B3

rectangle "**Capa 2 — Integración**\n----\nxUnit + WebApplicationFactory<Program>\n----\nControllers + EF Core + PostgreSQL\n(in-memory o test DB)\n----\nCantidad media · velocidad media" as INTEGRATION #FFE699

rectangle "**Capa 1 — Unitarios (base)**\n----\nxUnit + FluentAssertions + Moq\n----\nValue Objects · Services · Validators · Domain Logic\n----\nMuchos tests · rápidos · feedback inmediato" as UNIT #B3E6B3

E2E -[hidden]down-> INTEGRATION
INTEGRATION -[hidden]down-> UNIT

note right of E2E
  **Cobertura objetivo**
  >= 70% backend
  >= 60% frontend crítico
end note

rectangle "CI — GitHub Actions" as CI #E6E6E6 {
  rectangle "Job: unit-tests\n(Capa 1)" as JobUnit #B3E6B3
  rectangle "Job: integration-tests\n(Capa 2)" as JobInt #FFE699
  rectangle "Job: e2e-tests\n(Capa 3)" as JobE2E #FFB3B3
}

note bottom of CI
  Si la cobertura cae bajo el umbral,
  el pipeline falla (build breaker)
end note

UNIT -right-> JobUnit : ejecuta
INTEGRATION -right-> JobInt : ejecuta
E2E -right-> JobE2E : ejecuta

@enduml